WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.501
-Here's how the game works.

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:04.637
One person puts on
these headphones

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.305
with very loud music playing.

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:07.507
You can play this at home.

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:08.908
The other person picks up a card

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.010
and reads the random phrase
on that card.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.411
And the person
wearing headphones

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:15.147
has to try and guess what
the other person said.

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:16.482
Will, you put the headphones
on first,

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:18.384
and I'll read a phrase to you,

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:19.986
and then you'll guess
what I'm saying.

00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:24.323
Let's make sure
the music is playing.

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:26.059
Can you hear me?
-No.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:27.961
-Can you hear me?
-Huh?

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:29.595
Good.

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:30.763
Music's playing?
-Yeah.

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:38.304
-Yeah.
-Good.

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:41.274
A beautiful day in the
neighborhood.

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:44.377
-A boot full of...

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.145
-A beautiful day --
a beautiful day --

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:48.648
-A boat full --

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:51.584
What?

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:52.785
-A beautiful day in the
neighborhood.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:53.953
-A beautiful day in the
neighborhood.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:54.954
[ Dinging ]

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:58.657
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:58.657 --> 00:01:01.727
-What?!
How did you know that?

00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:03.262
Did you peek at my card?

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:06.332
-No, you have
very readable lips.

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:13.306
-It is my turn here.

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:14.373
Let's see how I do.
-You do it now?

00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:15.474
-Yeah.
-Oh, okay.

00:01:15.474 --> 00:01:21.047
-Sorry. Oh, yeah.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:22.682
I like this.
I want to download this.

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:25.184
-You should.

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:31.624
-Okay.
-Yeah? Yep, yep, yep, yep.

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:35.294
I have a shoplifting problem.

00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:36.962
-I have --

00:01:36.962 --> 00:01:40.333
-I have a serious
shoplifting problem.

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:46.205
Stealing makes me feel big.

00:01:46.205 --> 00:01:50.176
-Cheddar cheese?
-I steal everything.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:53.312
Groceries, books, cold medicine.

00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:58.952
I know I'm sick,
but I can't help myself.

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:01.955
-Help?
-It's like a high to me.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.657
I love the danger of
almost getting caught.

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.392
-Slow down. Slow down.
Slow down.

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:08.861
Slow down.
-Can you imagine the headlines?

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:12.932
"Will Ferrell arrested for
shoplifting at Kohl's."

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.702
God, that'd be so humiliating.
-Beer koozie.

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:19.238
-But what can I say?
It turns me on.

00:02:19.238 --> 00:02:21.807
-Attorney at law?
I have no clue. I'm sorry.

00:02:21.807 --> 00:02:23.576
-No, it was Baby Yoda.

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.612
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:29.448 --> 00:02:33.719
-I should have gotten Baby Yoda.
That's pretty famous.

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:34.721
You were just saying Baby Yoda
over and over?

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:38.023
-Do I go?
-Yeah, you go.

00:02:38.023 --> 00:02:46.365
-Okay. You put on
the headphones.

00:02:46.365 --> 00:02:47.667
Imposs--
-Impossible Whopper.

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:49.502
[ Dinging ]

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:55.341
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:58.243
-How?
-It's a gift. It's a gift.

00:02:58.243 --> 00:03:01.214
Your turn.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:02.548
-Okay. Alright.
We'll do one more round.

00:03:02.548 --> 00:03:06.952
-One more round? Okay.
-I'm feeling good about this.

00:03:06.952 --> 00:03:10.256
Okay, let's do it. Come on.
I can do it. I can do it.

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:12.525
-Do you like cults?

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:14.627
I'm starting one,
and guess what --

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:17.697
you're my first member.

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:19.464
I've already seized
your bank accounts

00:03:19.464 --> 00:03:21.567
and stolen your identity.

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:24.503
You shouldn't
leave your e-mail open.

00:03:24.503 --> 00:03:25.671
Do you know how easy
it is to find

00:03:25.671 --> 00:03:28.074
a Social Security number?

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:31.344
I'm going to erase you.

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:34.981
-Shush? California raisins?

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:38.284
-We'll worship
Jonathan Lipnicki as a God.

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:40.787
We're going to use your money
to build a temple

00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:43.789
dedicated to the
Jonathan Lipnicki movie

00:03:43.789 --> 00:03:46.992
"The Little Vampire."

00:03:46.992 --> 00:03:52.398
And your new legal name
will be Jonathan Lopnocki,

00:03:52.398 --> 00:03:56.636
because it's as close as we can
get to naming you

00:03:56.636 --> 00:04:00.139
after our new God
without angering him.

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:01.707
-Anger management?

00:04:01.707 --> 00:04:03.610
-I'm gonna dye your hair blond

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.412
and make you wear
little, round glasses.

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:09.482
And instead of "hello,"
you'll greet me by saying,

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:14.187
"Did you know that the human
head weighs 8 pounds?"

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:17.991
And then, I'll say, "Really?
Let's find out for ourselves."

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:21.026
And that's when I'm gonna pop
your pretty little head off

00:04:21.026 --> 00:04:24.397
like a [bleep] dandelion.

00:04:24.397 --> 00:04:28.468
All it takes is a dull knife
and 10 minutes.

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:30.503
And that's when
I take your glasses

00:04:30.503 --> 00:04:35.341
and I put them on my own face
and then I see what God sees.

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:40.146
Then I see what our God,
Jonathan Lipnicki, sees.

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:42.581
-Then I see what our God,
Jonathan Lipnicki, sees.

00:04:42.581 --> 00:04:43.616
Nailed it.
-Yeah!

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:44.617
[ Dinging ]

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:46.285
You got it.
-Great.

00:04:46.285 --> 00:04:47.387
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:47.387 --> 00:04:48.721
-We're good --
-Yeah.

00:04:48.721 --> 00:04:50.856
-We're good at this.
Will Ferrell, everybody!

00:04:50.856 --> 00:04:52.425
-The second time.
-That's the second time.

